<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1960847105"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1822731593"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Eutopia"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="法元明菜"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Eutopia / EMOTION / stars we chase【鐘 嵐珠盤】"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:09.720"><div begin="00:01.830" end="03:57.256"><p begin="00:01.830" end="00:06.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">"Hey. It's me! 准备好没?"</p><p begin="00:07.025" end="00:10.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">もっと熱く高く 光よりもはやく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加热烈 更加高远 比光速更快</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to a tsu ku ta ka ku hi ka ri yo ri mo ha ya ku</span></p><p begin="00:10.752" end="00:16.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Your heart 連れてくよ Higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我带上你的心一起 飞得更高更远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Your heart tsu re te ku yo higher</span></p><p begin="00:30.953" end="00:32.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">圧倒的に Stunning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我艳压全场的魅力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a 't to u te ki ni stunning</span></p><p begin="00:32.796" end="00:34.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">感じるはず Cuz why not?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你应该也感受到了才对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru ha zu cuz why not？</span></p><p begin="00:34.678" end="00:36.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">ドキドキをあげる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你体会到心动的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ki do ki wo a ge ru</span></p><p begin="00:36.381" end="00:38.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Come on! It's show time!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧！看我表演！</span></p><p begin="00:38.377" end="00:40.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">それっぽいだけじゃあね (Uh-uh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是这种程度的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re 'p po i da ke ja a ne (Uh-uh)</span></p><p begin="00:40.233" end="00:42.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">物足りないでしょ So<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉还意犹未尽吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no ta ri na i de sho so</span></p><p begin="00:42.526" end="00:44.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">欢迎来到我的天地<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">わたしの世界へようこそ</span></p><p begin="00:44.736" end="00:48.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Anyone can keep up with me? Anyone?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有人能跟得上我的步伐吗？有吗？</span></p><p begin="00:48.833" end="00:52.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">孤城から見渡す景色<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从孤城看到的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gu cheng ka ra mi wa ta su ke shi ki</span></p><p begin="00:52.876" end="00:56.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">知ってるの 私だけね！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我一个人知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't te ru no wa ta shi da ke ne</span></p><p begin="00:56.669" end="01:03.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">我就是那么完美 Ah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">私ってば最高 Ah!</span></p><p begin="01:01.229" end="01:05.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">もっとAddictedに Intoxicatedに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你更加上瘾 让你更加沉醉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to addicted ni intoxicated ni</span></p><p begin="01:05.046" end="01:08.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">全部射抜いてあげる Ooh I'm too good!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我来将全部一一击穿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu i nu i te a ge ru</span></p><p begin="01:08.905" end="01:12.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">怖いものなんてない お遊びはオシマイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有什么值得畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no na n te na i</span></p><p begin="01:12.605" end="01:17.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ここから全てが始まってくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来一切才要开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra su be te ga ha ji ma 't te ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:17.966" end="01:19.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Top of the top!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="01:19.803" end="01:21.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Top of the world!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冠绝世间！</span></p><p begin="01:21.667" end="01:24.872" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Top of the top! (I AM THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="01:23.412" end="01:25.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">这地球就是绕着我转<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">地球は私を軸に回ってる</span></p><p begin="01:25.436" end="01:27.879" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Top of the top! (CUZ I)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="01:27.342" end="01:29.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Top of the world! (AM)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冠绝世间！</span></p><p begin="01:29.089" end="01:32.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Top of the top! (THE BEST OF THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="01:32.517" end="01:34.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">"怎样，不错吧 Huh?"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“気に入ったでしょ？”</span></p><p begin="01:34.675" end="01:36.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">高ぶる思い It's burning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越发高昂的情感在热烈燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ka bu ru o mo i it's burning</span></p><p begin="01:36.554" end="01:38.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">感じるはず Eye to Eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你应该也感受到了吧 在和我四目相对间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru ha zu eye to eye</span></p><p begin="01:38.386" end="01:40.104" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">ドキドキがとまんない？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扑通的心跳已经停不下来了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ki do ki ga to ma n na i ？</span></p><p begin="01:40.114" end="01:41.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Don't miss the best time!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">及时行乐还趁现在！</span></p><p begin="01:41.927" end="01:44.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">私じゃなくちゃあね (Oh yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须是我才可以做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ja na ku cha a ne (oh yeah)</span></p><p begin="01:43.781" end="01:45.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">物足りないってほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">否则就会感到不足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo no ta ri na i 't te ho do</span></p><p begin="01:46.402" end="01:48.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">我来吸引这世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">わたしの魅力で世界をひきつけていく</span></p><p begin="01:48.526" end="01:52.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I'm the one who you've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是你一直等待的那个人</span></p><p begin="01:51.723" end="01:52.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">(You know that?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想要最棒的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zui bang de shi ka ho shi ku na i</span></p><p begin="01:52.599" end="01:56.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">最棒的しか欲しくない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有最高のもの才能入我法眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zui bang de shi ka ho shi ku na i</span></p><p begin="01:56.687" end="02:00.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">思いのまま 私ならね！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要随心所欲做我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i no ma ma wa ta shi na ra ne</span></p><p begin="02:00.458" end="02:06.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">谁让我那么完美 Ah!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">だって私は完璧だもの Ah!</span></p><p begin="02:05.029" end="02:08.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">もっとMajesticに Enthusiasticに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我更加势不可挡 让我更加热情四射</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to majestic ni enthusiastic ni</span></p><p begin="02:08.872" end="02:12.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">視線奪ってあげる Ooh I'm too bad!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我夺去你所有的视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi se n u ba 't te a ge ru</span></p><p begin="02:12.624" end="02:16.384" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">躊躇うことなんてない 綻びは見せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不会踌躇犹豫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra u ko to na n te na i</span></p><p begin="02:16.394" end="02:21.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">ここから世界は広がってくよ 明日へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来世界将更为广阔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra se ka i wa hi ro ga 't te ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:23.221" end="02:29.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">(I AM THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(I AM THE BEST!)</span></p><p begin="02:30.387" end="02:36.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">(CUZ I AM THE BEST OF THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(CUZ I AM THE BEST OF THE BEST!)</span></p><p begin="02:35.128" end="02:43.859" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">胸に手を当ててみたなら探して 本当の心を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把掌心放在胸前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne ni te wo a te te mi ta na ra sa ga shi te</span></p><p begin="02:36.253" end="02:43.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">(One, two, three, four… Again…)<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne ni te wo a te te mi ta na ra sa ga shi te</span></p><p begin="02:43.869" end="02:48.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">絶えず突き上げる振動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">源源不断翻涌的颤动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta e zu tsu ki a ge ru shi n do u ga</span></p><p begin="02:43.855" end="02:49.118" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">(One, two, three and four… )<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不绝擂动的心跳声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta e zu tsu ki a ge ru shi n do u ga</span></p><p begin="02:49.128" end="02:51.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">告げる真実を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在向我宣告着真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ge ru shi n ji tsu wo</span></p><p begin="02:51.960" end="02:55.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">ほら バイアスや思い込みが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 就算偏见抑或臆想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ba i a su ya o mo i ko mi ga</span></p><p begin="02:55.687" end="02:59.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">邪魔をしても 目を閉じないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前来设防 也不要闭上眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja ma wo shi te mo me wo to ji na i de</span></p><p begin="02:59.466" end="03:06.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">私は逃げない！最高を見せたい！貫くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝对不会逃避</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ni ge na i</span></p><p begin="03:06.917" end="03:10.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">もっと熱く高く 光よりもはやく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加热烈 更加高远 比光速更快</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to a tsu ku ta ka ku hi ka ri yo ri mo ha ya ku</span></p><p begin="03:10.709" end="03:14.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">Your heart 連れて そう どこまでも Higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我带上你的心一起 去往无尽高远的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Your heart tsu re te so u do ko ma de mo higher</span></p><p begin="03:14.514" end="03:18.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">躊躇うことなんてない 綻びは見せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我再也不会踌躇犹豫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra u ko to na n te na i</span></p><p begin="03:18.268" end="03:24.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">ここから歴史は刻まれてくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来我将创造历史</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra re ki shi wa ki za ma re te ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:24.714" end="03:26.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Just follow me!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟我来就好！</span></p><p begin="03:25.717" end="03:29.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">もっとAddictedに Intoxicatedに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你更加上瘾 让你更加沉醉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to addicted ni intoxicated ni</span></p><p begin="03:29.438" end="03:33.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">全部射抜いてあげる Ooh I'm too good!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我来将全部一一击穿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu i nu i te a ge ru</span></p><p begin="03:33.248" end="03:36.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">怖いものなんてない お遊びはオシマイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有什么值得畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no na n te na i</span></p><p begin="03:37.009" end="03:41.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">ここから全てが始まってくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来一切才要开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra su be te ga ha ji ma 't te ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:42.305" end="03:44.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">Top of the top!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="03:44.194" end="03:45.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">Top of the world!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冠绝世间！</span></p><p begin="03:45.982" end="03:49.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">Top of the top! (I AM THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！(I AM THE BEST！)</span></p><p begin="03:47.790" end="03:49.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">这地球就是绕着我转<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">地球は私を軸に回ってる</span></p><p begin="03:49.848" end="03:52.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">Top of the top!(CUZ I)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！</span></p><p begin="03:51.609" end="03:54.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">Top of the world!(AM)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冠绝世间！</span></p><p begin="03:53.676" end="03:57.256" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">Top of the top! (THE BEST OF THE BEST!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巅峰之巅！ (CUZ I AM THE BEST OF THE BEST！)</span></p></div></body></tt>